				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-4c94bd7 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent" data-id="4c94bd7" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}">
					<div class="e-con-inner">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-d4a5625 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget-mobile__width-inherit elementor-widget elementor-widget-theme-post-title elementor-page-title elementor-widget-heading" data-id="d4a5625" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="theme-post-title.default">
					<h1 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Audiência Pública: LOTEAMENTO DE ACESSO CONTROLADO</h1>				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-b950d45 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget-tablet__width-initial elementor-widget-mobile__width-inherit elementor-widget elementor-widget-jet-listing-dynamic-field" data-id="b950d45" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="jet-listing-dynamic-field.default">
					<div class="jet-listing jet-listing-dynamic-field display-inline"><div class="jet-listing-dynamic-field__inline-wrap"><div class="jet-listing-dynamic-field__content" ><p><span style="color: #ffffff; text-shadow: 2px 2px 4px #000000;">O Instituto de Planejamento de Cascavel apresentará em audiência pública a minuta de projeto de lei que institui a modalidade de <b data-path-to-node="3,0" data-index-in-node="137">Loteamento de Acesso Controlado</b> . A iniciativa responde à demanda por novos modelos urbanísticos pautados na escala humana, inspirados em experiências consolidadas de bairros planejados no país.</span></p>
<div><span style="color: #ffffff; text-shadow: 2px 2px 4px #000000;">A audiência pública ocorrerá:</span></div>
<ul data-path-to-node="7">
<li>
<div><span style="color: #ffffff; text-shadow: 2px 2px 4px #000000;"><b data-path-to-node="7,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">Data:</b> 23 de novembro de 2026</span></div>
</li>
<li>
<div><span style="color: #ffffff; text-shadow: 2px 2px 4px #000000;"><b data-path-to-node="7,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">Horário:</b> 18h00</span></div>
</li>
<li>
<div><span style="color: #ffffff; text-shadow: 2px 2px 4px #000000;"><b data-path-to-node="7,2,0" data-index-in-node="0">Local:</b> Plenário da Câmara Municipal de Vereadores de Cascavel</span></div>
</li>
</ul>
</div></div></div>				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-2b673cc elementor-mobile-align-center elementor-widget elementor-widget-button" data-id="2b673cc" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="button.default">
										<a class="elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-sm" href="https://ipc.cascavel.pr.gov.br/projeto/loteamento-de-acesso-controlado/">
						<span class="elementor-button-content-wrapper">
